@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api
@documentId = replace-with-uploaded-id

### All four dependencies must be available
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Most recent 100 documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### Use the uploaded id; poll until ready or failed, then read text
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}

### Search filename/title/extracted body (up to 200 characters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?q=APEX

### Next page after the preceding page's last document id
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?after={{documentId}}

### Download original with UTF-8 filename
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/file

### Open original PDF (non-PDF returns 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/file?preview=1

### Byte range (206; invalid range returns 416)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/file
Range: bytes=0-15

### Upload a document (20 MiB maximum)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=apex-boundary

--apex-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

APEX document upload verification.
--apex-boundary--

### Missing file must return 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=apex-empty

--apex-empty--
